      "text": "The particle's kinetic energy increases by a factor of <math><mn>4</mn></math> when the piston is moved inward from <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></math> to <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></math>",
